mall leads.\n\nExpert raters are split: Cook, Inside Elections, Sabato and Fox News call it a Tossup, while several others rate it a Democratic flip. Prediction markets give Stelson roughly a two-in-three to four-in-five chance. Local coverage highlights moderate and dissident Republicans as a potential swing group. The race is competitive but tilts narrowly toward Stelson.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.7335, "margin": 3.68}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.7265, "margin": 3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.7615, "margin": 4.2}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.7786, "margin": 4.2}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.7238, "margin": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.7163, "margin": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.7699, "margin": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.7923, "margin": 4.5}]}